1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:12,257
Writing, task one. Form number 16. You want to join a cooking course. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:12,967 --> 00:00:14,474
How often do you cook and what?

3
00:00:24,867 --> 00:00:29,365
I cook almost every day, mainly soups, pasta and dishes from my country.

4
00:00:30,267 --> 00:00:32,070
What do you want to learn in the course?

5
00:00:42,467 --> 00:00:46,368
In the course I want to learn to cook Czech dishes, for example svíčková and dumplings.

6
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:48,725
When do you have time for the course?

7
00:00:59,133 --> 00:01:02,142
I have time for the course on Wednesday evening or Saturday morning.

8
00:01:03,033 --> 00:01:11,942
Fill in form 16 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
